book-text-supermatter =
    ──────────────────────────────────
    SUPERMATTER: OPERATIONS MANUAL
    Classification: STRICTLY CONFIDENTIAL
    Posthumous edition, revised.
    ──────────────────────────────────

    If you are reading this — the previous engineer is likely dead. Our condolences. The crystal is now your responsibility. Pray you do better.

    ═══════════════════════════════════
    I. WHAT IS SUPERMATTER
    ═══════════════════════════════════

    The supermatter crystal is an anomalous object of unknown origin. It absorbs the surrounding atmosphere, processes it, and expels superheated waste gas, plasma, and oxygen. The byproduct is radiation.

    DO NOT TOUCH IT. Any physical contact converts matter to ash. Instantly. No exceptions. Seventeen interns have already confirmed this.

    ═══════════════════════════════════
    II. HOW IT WORKS
    ═══════════════════════════════════

    The crystal absorbs 15% of the gas on its tile every second. Gas composition determines behavior:

    • Power — increases from gas temperature.
    • Heat — the crystal heats expelled gas.
    • Radiation — proportional to power.
    • Damage — accumulates from overheating, overpressure, or vacuum exposure.

    Upon reaching critical damage, DELAMINATION begins — an irreversible process. 15 seconds until explosion. Not enough time to reach the shuttle.

    ═══════════════════════════════════
    III. GASES AND THEIR EFFECTS
    ═══════════════════════════════════

    « SAFE »

    ► Nitrogen (N2) — your best friend. Cools the crystal, reduces power generation. Always keep the chamber filled with nitrogen.

    ► Nitrous Oxide (N2O) — raises the heat damage threshold by 6x. The crystal can withstand temperatures that melt steel. Do not breathe this.

    ► Frezon — emergency brake. Cools, suppresses power, reduces radiation. Use during catastrophe. If frezon doesn't help — run.

    « OPERATIONAL »

    ► Carbon Dioxide (CO2) — completely blocks power decay. The crystal retains accumulated energy. Caution: slightly increases heating.

    ► Oxygen (O2) — minor radiation boost, neutral heating. Safe in small amounts.

    ► Ammonia (NH3) — minimal effect. Useless.

    « DANGEROUS »

    ► Tritium — MAXIMUM radiation output. Strong heating. Use only if you understand what you're doing. You probably don't.

    ► Water Vapor (H2O) — extreme heating with zero benefit. Do not use.

    ► Plasma — LETHAL. Heat output x15. If plasma enters the chamber — you have minutes until delamination.

    ═══════════════════════════════════
    IV. DAMAGE SOURCES
    ═══════════════════════════════════

    The crystal takes damage from four sources:

    1. OVERHEATING — gas hotter than 313K.
    2. POWER EXCESS — Power above 5000.
    3. PRESSURE EXCESS — more than 1800 moles of gas.
    4. VACUUM — the most dangerous. Chamber breach = rapid crystal death.

    The crystal heals VERY slowly. If damage starts climbing — act immediately.

    ═══════════════════════════════════
    V. RECOMMENDED SETUP
    ═══════════════════════════════════

    1. Fill the chamber with pure nitrogen.
    2. Ensure airtight seal. Check twice.
    3. Configure cooling via heat exchangers.
    4. Configure waste filtration — the crystal expels plasma and oxygen. Without filtration the chamber becomes a furnace.
    5. Keep frezon reserves for emergencies.
    6. DO NOT LET PLASMA INTO THE CHAMBER.
    7. ACTIVATE EMITTERS. Without an external energy source the crystal is useless. But only after everything above is done. Activating emitters before cooling is configured is a guaranteed way to die.

    ═══════════════════════════════════
    VI. DELAMINATION PROTOCOL
    ═══════════════════════════════════

    If the crystal begins countdown:

    1. You have 15 seconds.
    2. Do not attempt repairs — it's too late.
    3. Evacuate.
    4. Pray.

    A supermatter explosion will annihilate everything within blast radius. Walls, bulkheads, dreams of promotion — all reduced to ash and radiation.

